        <mxCell id="msg-agent2-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2B4B;align=left;" value="🤖  Analysis: Rosneft Trading SA vs OFAC SDN Record" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="764" x="308" y="606" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg-agent2-body" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4A5568;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="The OFAC SDN record lists &quot;Rosneft Oil Company&quot; (SDN ID: 26563) headquartered in Moscow, Russia.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;Your document references &quot;Rosneft Trading SA&quot; — a Geneva-based trading subsidiary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;OFAC guidance states that subsidiaries 50%+ owned by an SDN entity are themselves subject to sanctions under the 50% rule,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;even if not individually listed.  Match score is 83% due to the name variation (parent vs. subsidiary) and different jurisdictions (RU vs. CH).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;However, given the ownership structure, this is likely a genuine sanctions exposure.  ⚠️  Recommendation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Treat as a confirmed hit pending legal review. Do not proceed with the transaction.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="96" width="764" x="308" y="628" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="agent2-cite" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#A0AEC0;align=left;" value="Sources: OFAC SDN List (ofac.treas.gov)  ·  OFAC FAQ #398 (50% Rule)  ·  BIS CSL API result ref: CSL-20260706-R8821" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="14" width="764" x="308" y="728" as="geometry" />
